        "text_9mKbia": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Dear Parent,<\/strong><br\/><br\/>If you’re like me, you’re worried about the “new normal” and how society promotes a victimhood mentality and other woke ideals.<br\/><br\/>Politicians, pundits and their fans have created a mythical world where everyone is a victim, and only the government can make things better.<br\/><br\/>Cranking up the money presses for “inflation reduction” and student loan forgiveness is their idea of saving the world.<br\/><br\/>It’s truly insane, but it only works as long as Americans go along with the idea that everyone is a victim.<br\/><br\/>This is why Jordan Peterson is viewed as “controversial” by many. His ideas would have been considered  common sense less than a generation ago.<br\/><br\/>The public school system, the mainstream media, and the entertainment industry no longer share ideas such as personal responsibility and individual liberty. They’re too busy pushing crazy ideas like woke-ism and a victimhood mentality into the minds of our kids.<br\/><br\/>These radical messages work their way into school curriculum, movies, advertising, and social media platforms to <strong>persuade our impressionable children.<\/strong><\/p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
