    "ssky_text_block_YGi4RB": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "text_akwtCX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Parents like you struggle to find educational material that doesn’t lie about our nation’s history or teach that the government is the solution to our problems.<br\/><br\/>You want to help your children learn about true history, sound money, personal freedom and responsibility, entrepreneurship, individual rights, and more.<br\/><br\/><strong>You find yourself asking, “What exactly are my children learning at school…?”<\/strong><br\/><br\/>And even if you homeschool, you are always on the hunt for a new curriculum to make sure your children are being taught good principles and true ideas.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_akwtCX"
      ],
      "settings": {
