    "ssky_text_block_REjd84": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_jDLHrB": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "With our books, your children will learn things like:",
            "custom_color": "",
            "text_style": "large-semibold",
            "color_class": ""
          }
        },
        "text_dqiDaq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<ul><li>Why a <strong>free market<\/strong> economy is the greatest way to lift people out of poverty and allow people to trade with one another.<\/li><li>How <strong>property rights<\/strong> allows us to decide what’s best for us, and make decisions for our family.<\/li><li>Why the world is a better place because of <strong>entrepreneurs<\/strong> who create businesses to help serve us and improve our lives.<\/li><li>What <strong>socialism<\/strong> is and why it is so destructive to our freedoms and well being.<\/li><li>How the <strong>Golden Rule<\/strong> is so important to people getting along with one another, no matter where we live, what we look like, or what we believe.<\/li><li>Why <strong>education is so important<\/strong>, and why children should be allowed to learn things they are interested in.<\/li><li>What <strong>true laws<\/strong> are, and why the government should protect our rights.<\/li><li>…and so much more!<\/li><\/ul>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "caption_jDLHrB",
        "text_dqiDaq"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "content_alignment": "left",
