    "ssky_text_image_block_mCN4M7": {
      "type": "ssky-text-image-block",
      "blocks": {
        "text_MNcNw4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>And each of our books come with discussion questions at the end, helping parents like you have <em>amazing<\/em> conversations with their children about these rich ideas.<\/p><p>We get emails daily from parents who are blown away at how much they learned alongside their children—and how their conversations over dinner have “leveled up” by talking about real-world concepts about what’s happening in the world.<\/p><p>You owe it to your children to give them this well-rounded education that schools aren’t teaching—and the Tuttle Twins books make it super easy for you.<\/p><p>Your children can read these books on their own, or you can read along with them — and be sure to use the FREE activity workbooks we provide, to reinforce these new ideas your children will be learning.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_MNcNw4"
