    "ssky_custom_block_HGTgMp": {
      "type": "ssky-custom-block",
      "blocks": {
        "two_columns_text_cmmfwg": {
          "type": "two_columns_text",
          "settings": {
            "left_heading": "<h2>How does it work?<\/h2>",
            "left_heading_size": "h2",
            "left_heading_weight": "bold",
            "left_heading_tag": "h2",
            "left_text": "<p>You can read these books to your kids, or they can simply read them themselves. Once they do, they will have the vocabulary to ask questions that lead to inspiring conversations. And with this new perspective, They will be encouraged to learn even more, ask bigger questions, and even take action—like writing an elected official or starting a small business.<\/p><p>Our optional activity workbooks and parent guides will enhance the process and enable you as a parent to make sure your child learns all of the many principles and concepts covered in the Tuttle Twins books.<\/p>",
            "left_text_size": "medium",
            "left_text_weight": "regular",
            "right_heading": "<h2>You have nothing to lose.<\/h2>",
            "right_heading_size": "h2",
            "right_heading_weight": "bold",
            "right_heading_tag": "h2",
            "right_text": "<p>These books allow you to instill your children with the values you believe in and remember, if you don’t teach them true ideas, others will teach them false ones soon. We are in a sort of war for our minds, and it’s critical that we parents protect our children by teaching them correct principles.<\/p><p><em>Those who don’t learn from the past are condemned to repeat it.<\/em> Don’t let your children become indoctrinated by the media and other voices that want to spread socialism. <\/p><p>Help your children recognize truth and learn to think for themselves. The Tuttle Twins books are here to help.<\/p>",
            "right_text_size": "regular",
            "right_text_weight": "regular",
            "background": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "#0a0a0a",
            "rounded": false
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LGqdBf": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>My oldest is seven years old. He is autistic, on the high-functioning side. Speech therapy is via Zoom. So we've been reading a LOT more. He loves The Creature from Jekyll Island!! He now has made his own money to buy a very specific train he wants for Christmas.<\/p>",
            "font_size": 18,
            "background": "#3f3939",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "profile_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Carrie-Hammer.jpg",
            "profile_name": "Carrie Hammer",
            "profile_location": "",
            "image_position": "image-right",
            "show_star": false,
            "stars": 5,
            "narrow_width": false
          }
        }
